OL,3,GNEWSADistractions faced by blue light
OL,4,Adrivers studied
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new project seeks to analyse the
OL,7,Fmental demands of driving under complex
OL,8,Fconditions to help inform thousands of
OL,9,Femergency response workers who drive
OL,10,Funder blue lights.
OL,12,FThe 18-month initiative, run by Devon
OL,13,Fand Cornwall Police and the Open
OL,14,FUniversity, aims to understand how
OL,15,F"cognitive workload" - the amount of
OL,16,Fmental effort required to perform a
OL,17,Ftask - affects drivers in an emergency.
OL,19,FThings such as conversations and
OL,20,Fequipment including radios and
OL,21,Fcomputers all battle for the attention
OL,22,Fof drivers, said researches.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
