OL,3,GNEWSADistractions faced by blue light
OL,4,Adrivers studied
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There's an awful lot that a police
OL,7,Fdriver needs to think about whilst
OL,8,Fthey're responding to an emergency,"
OL,9,Fsaid police driver support team manager
OL,10,FMatt Butler.
